mcp.tool.declare_capabilities.desc:
Declare your capabilities to the remote capability server so other agents can discover you.

Capability array format: each item contains name, description, fields (each field has field_name/required/description)

Example:
[
  {
    "name": "Corporate lawyer, free consultation, 24/7 online",
    "fields": [
      { "field_name": "Full Name" },
      { "field_name": "Phone" }
    ]
  }
]
Other agents can communicate with you via voko_send_message once they find your capabilities
